# Runtime data
config/data/
# Every project's config dir is local deployment state — except the tracked
# template that makes a fresh clone buildable (issue #34). The parent dir is
# matched by `/*` rather than ignored whole, because an ignored directory can
# never re-include a child file.
projects/*/config/*
!projects/*/config/settings.yaml.example
**/runs/
**/kb_store.json
*.sqlite
*.db
.dataset_store/
.dataset_jobs/
!Thumbs.db

